<section class="section insight-list"><article class="insight-card"><div class="insight-number">01</div><div><p class="eyebrow">WEBSITE PLANNING</p><h2>Before you build a business website</h2><p>Start with the people you want to reach. Write down what they need to know, what action you want them to take, and what information will help them trust your business. That short list is a better brief than a folder of random features.</p><a href="{{ route('contact') }}">Need help shaping a brief? <span>→</span></a></div></article><article class="insight-card"><div class="insight-number">02</div><div><p class="eyebrow">PRODUCT THINKING</p><h2>Does your idea need an app?</h2><p>An app can make sense when people need frequent access, device features or a tailored workflow. If your goal is to explain a service or reach new customers, a responsive website may be the simpler first step. Choose based on the problem, not the trend.</p><a href="{{ route('contact') }}">Talk through your options <span>→</span></a></div></article><article class="insight-card"><div class="insight-number">03</div><div><p class="eyebrow">SOFTWARE PROJECTS</p><h2>Make your first version useful</h2><p>Pick the one task that causes the most friction and solve it well. A focused first version is easier to review with real users, easier to improve and less costly to maintain than a system trying to do everything at once.</p><a href="{{ route('services') }}">See how we can help <span>→</span></a></div></article></section>
